{
    "title": "Zillow Rental Manager",
    "description": "Landlords, save time with everything you need to fill your vacancy \u2014 from listing to leasing \u2014 all in one place. Our easy-to-use tools let you list your property where over 34M visitors search each month. Once you find a renter, you can screen them and collect rent, entirely online.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Dark mode!\r\n\u2022 Add, edit and publish your rental listings\r\n\u2022 Set your rent price\r\n\u2022 Add unlimited photos\r\n\u2022 Receive notifications as soon as a renter asks about your property and message them in the app\r\n\u2022 Manage, send, accept rental applications\r\n\u2022 Get verifiable information about your applicant upfront, such as income and credit score\r\n\u2022 Build your own digital move-in checklist to avoid having to store photos and files in different places\r\n\u2022 Collect online rent payments",
    "descriptionHTML": "Landlords, save time with everything you need to fill your vacancy \u2014 from listing to leasing \u2014 all in one place. Our easy-to-use tools let you list your property where over 34M visitors search each month. Once you find a renter, you can screen them and collect rent, entirely online.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>\u2022 Dark mode!<br>\u2022 Add, edit and publish your rental listings<br>\u2022 Set your rent price<br>\u2022 Add unlimited photos<br>\u2022 Receive notifications as soon as a renter asks about your property and message them in the app<br>\u2022 Manage, send, accept rental applications<br>\u2022 Get verifiable information about your applicant upfront, such as income and credit score<br>\u2022 Build your own digital move-in checklist to avoid having to store photos and files in different places<br>\u2022 Collect online rent payments",
